    "text": "By Max Preston ,\n1 days ago\nThe Amarillo High and Tascosa boys and girls basketball teams met up Tuesday afternoon in a double header. The scores are as follows:\nGirls matchup\nTascosa 45 Amarillo High 35\nBoys matchup\nAmarillo High 41 Tascosa 36 (OT)\nFor the latest Amarillo news and regional updates, check with MyHighPlains.com and tune in to KAMR Local 4 News at 5:00, 6:00, and 10:00 p.m. and Fox 14 News at 9:00 p.m. CST.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KAMR - MyHighPlains.com.\n1",
